ication in empirical research and policy analysis.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": [], "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "protected_material_code": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "protected_material_text": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}], "created": 1771166214, "model": "gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_f97eff32c5", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 796, "prompt_tokens": 295, "total_tokens": 1091, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}, "prompt_filter_results": [{"prompt_index": 0, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "jailbreak": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}]}, "input": {"messages": [{"content": "\nYou are an expert econometrician responsible for generating comprehensive summaries of econometric concepts, methods, tests, or models.\n\nGiven one or more econometric entities (such as regression methods, statistical tests, assumptions, or models), and a list of descriptions from the textbook, combine all descriptions into a single, comprehensive summary.\n\nGuidelines:\n1. Include all relevant information from all descriptions\n2. Preserve mathematical formulas and equations accurately\n3. Maintain technical precision in econometric terminology\n4. If descriptions provide different aspects (definition, formula, assumptions, applications), i